{"id":"b2726dc25b01fa48","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-lax-milgram.md","title":"Lax–Milgram Theorem","display":"thm-lax-milgram — Lax–Milgram Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-lax-milgram","aliases":["58-thm-lax-milgram"],"display":"thm-lax-milgram — Lax–Milgram Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","[[58-df-coercive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-lax-milgram"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-lax-milgram</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lax-milgram — Lax–Milgram Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"43ae8fb2a07f84ab\" href=\"?note=43ae8fb2a07f84ab\" title=\"58-df-coercive\">58-df-coercive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,B,a,F,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V\\in V_{\\mathrm{set}}\">\\(V,B,a,F,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V\\in V_{\\mathrm{set}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{\\mathrm{set}}\">\\(V_{\\mathrm{set}}\\)</span> 表示集合宇宙，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 表示向量空间载体；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\)</span> 取五参数接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_B=\\{\\langle v,\\sqrt{B(v,v)}\\rangle:v\\in V\\}\">\\(\\nu_B=\\{\\langle v,\\sqrt{B(v,v)}\\rangle:v\\in V\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda u+v\">\\(\\lambda u+v\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_V(\\langle\\odot_V(\\langle\\lambda,u\\rangle),v\\rangle)\">\\(+_V(\\langle\\odot_V(\\langle\\lambda,u\\rangle),v\\rangle)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline\\lambda=\\lambda\">\\(\\overline\\lambda=\\lambda\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span> 上成立。</li>\n<li>保留本文件第一变量线性、第二变量共轭线性的形式约定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LaxMilgramForm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LaxMilgramForm}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedLinearFunctional}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedLinearFunctional}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedAntilinearFunctional}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedAntilinearFunctional}_S\\)</span> 为下式定义的谓词。</li>\n<li>两个结论分别适用于线性泛函与共轭线性泛函，不将这两类泛函混同。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LaxMilgramForm}_S(a,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land a\\in\\mathbb K^{V^2}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u,v,w\\in V\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;\\bigl(\na(\\lambda u+v,w)=\\lambda a(u,w)+a(v,w)\\land\na(u,\\lambda v+w)=\\overline\\lambda a(u,v)+a(u,w)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall u,v\\in V\\;(|a(u,v)|\\leq C\\nu_B(u)\\nu_B(v))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;(\\operatorname{Re}a(v,v)\\geq c\\nu_B(v)^2).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LaxMilgramForm}_S(a,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land a\\in\\mathbb K^{V^2}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u,v,w\\in V\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;\\bigl(\na(\\lambda u+v,w)=\\lambda a(u,w)+a(v,w)\\land\na(u,\\lambda v+w)=\\overline\\lambda a(u,v)+a(u,w)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall u,v\\in V\\;(|a(u,v)|\\leq C\\nu_B(u)\\nu_B(v))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;(\\operatorname{Re}a(v,v)\\geq c\\nu_B(v)^2).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BoundedLinearFunctional}_S(F,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land F\\in\\mathbb K^V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u,v\\in V\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;(F(\\lambda u+v)=\\lambda F(u)+F(v))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;(|F(v)|\\leq C\\nu_B(v)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BoundedLinearFunctional}_S(F,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land F\\in\\mathbb K^V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u,v\\in V\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;(F(\\lambda u+v)=\\lambda F(u)+F(v))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;(|F(v)|\\leq C\\nu_B(v)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BoundedAntilinearFunctional}_S(F,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land F\\in\\mathbb K^V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u,v\\in V\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;(F(\\lambda u+v)=\\overline\\lambda F(u)+F(v))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;(|F(v)|\\leq C\\nu_B(v)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BoundedAntilinearFunctional}_S(F,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land F\\in\\mathbb K^V\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u,v\\in V\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;(F(\\lambda u+v)=\\overline\\lambda F(u)+F(v))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;(|F(v)|\\leq C\\nu_B(v)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lax\\text{-}milgram}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaxMilgramForm}_S(a,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\n\\mathrm{BoundedLinearFunctional}_S(F,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\n\\ \\to\\ \\exists!u\\in V\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;(a(v,u)=F(v)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lax\\text{-}milgram}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaxMilgramForm}_S(a,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\n\\mathrm{BoundedLinearFunctional}_S(F,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\n\\ \\to\\ \\exists!u\\in V\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;(a(v,u)=F(v)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lax\\text{-}milgram}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaxMilgramForm}_S(a,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\n\\mathrm{BoundedAntilinearFunctional}_S(F,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\n\\ \\to\\ \\exists!u\\in V\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;(a(u,v)=F(v)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lax\\text{-}milgram}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaxMilgramForm}_S(a,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\n\\mathrm{BoundedAntilinearFunctional}_S(F,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\n\\ \\to\\ \\exists!u\\in V\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;(a(u,v)=F(v)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原第一变量线性的约定保持不变。原文却同时要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 线性和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(u,v)=F(v)\">\\(a(u,v)=F(v)\\)</span>；在复数情形中，这两边对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的线性方向不一致。现在分别列出两种正确配对。</li>\n<li>有界性、正强制性常数、完备性及泛函范数界均在前两节中给出。两个同名文件仍位于各自原 batch 中，不合并、不更名。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-coercive","status":"resolved","id":"43ae8fb2a07f84ab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-coercive]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V,B,a,F,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V\\in V_{\\mathrm{set}}","display":false},{"tex":"V_{\\mathrm{set}}","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_B=\\{\\langle v,\\sqrt{B(v,v)}\\rangle:v\\in V\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda u+v","display":false},{"tex":"+_V(\\langle\\odot_V(\\langle\\lambda,u\\rangle),v\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline\\lambda=\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LaxMilgramForm}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedLinearFunctional}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedAntilinearFunctional}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LaxMilgramForm}_S(a,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land a\\in\\mathbb K^{V^2}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall u,v,w\\in V\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;\\bigl(\na(\\lambda u+v,w)=\\lambda a(u,w)+a(v,w)\\land\na(u,\\lambda v+w)=\\overline\\lambda a(u,v)+a(u,w)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall u,v\\in V\\;(|a(u,v)|\\leq C\\nu_B(u)\\nu_B(v))\\\\\n&\\land\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;(\\operatorname{Re}a(v,v)\\geq c\\nu_B(v)^2).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BoundedLinearFunctional}_S(F,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land F\\in\\mathbb K^V\\\\\n&\\land\\forall u,v\\in V\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;(F(\\lambda u+v)=\\lambda F(u)+F(v))\\\\\n&\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;(|F(v)|\\leq C\\nu_B(v)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BoundedAntilinearFunctional}_S(F,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land F\\in\\mathbb K^V\\\\\n&\\land\\forall u,v\\in V\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;(F(\\lambda u+v)=\\overline\\lambda F(u)+F(v))\\\\\n&\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;(|F(v)|\\leq C\\nu_B(v)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lax\\text{-}milgram}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaxMilgramForm}_S(a,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\n\\mathrm{BoundedLinearFunctional}_S(F,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\n\\ \\to\\ \\exists!u\\in V\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;(a(v,u)=F(v)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lax\\text{-}milgram}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaxMilgramForm}_S(a,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\n\\mathrm{BoundedAntilinearFunctional}_S(F,V,B,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V)\n\\ \\to\\ \\exists!u\\in V\\;\\forall v\\in V\\;(a(u,v)=F(v)).","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"a(u,v)=F(v)","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false}],"bytes":3299,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4274","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-lax-milgram.md|58-thm-lax-milgram]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["b70ce791d5b1a19b","43ae8fb2a07f84ab"]}